# Full-text PDFs of included studies: only open-licence (CC BY) PDFs are
# versioned. Publisher-licensed PDFs stay local; retrieve them via the DOIs in
# 06_included_studies/included_studies.csv. Already-tracked PDFs must also be
# removed from the index (git rm --cached) and from history before going public.
06_included_studies/*.pdf
!06_included_studies/ALOUFFI.pdf
!06_included_studies/DININGRAT.pdf
